A user reports the bug below. Was something like this fixed before in this repository? If so, which commit?

submodules of requests.packages.urllib3 are not equal to urllib3's

See title. Caused by the unbundling and related to e.g. #4072 

## Reproduction Steps

```python
import requests.packages.urllib3
import urllib3

from requests.packages.urllib3.connectionpool import HTTPConnection as old
from urllib3.connectionpool import HTTPConnection as new
assert old is new
```

The assertion should not fail, but does on my machine

